### List reports
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports?page=1&limit=10

### Search reports
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports?q=The

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/reports-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Golden Hour Report",
  "period": "Feb 2026",
  "revenue": 249000,
  "tickets": 4
}
